WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.824
The Chu army marched in mighty spirit, banners flying.

00:00:05.224 --> 00:00:09.664
Xiang Yu walked at the very front, in bronze armor with a red cape.

00:00:09.682 --> 00:00:13.210
After crossing the river, Xiang Yu ordered the cooking pots smashed.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.954
The soldiers raised their hammers and smashed the pots to pieces.

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:21.308
Next, they sank the boats one by one.

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:24.732
No pots to cook with, and no boats to go back on.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.230
Xiang Yu raised his arm high and gave a rousing speech.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.014
The soldiers raised their arms and shouted: "We will never retreat!"

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:35.368
The Chu army charged forward bravely and defeated the Qin army.

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:40.040
Qin banners fell one after another — victory belonged to Chu.

00:00:40.058 --> 00:00:44.138
The sun rose, and Xiang Yu stood on the hilltop.

00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:50.730
From then on, "breaking the cauldrons and sinking the boats" became an idiom for resolve with no way back.

